    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.poster.avif?t=1738845131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.webm?t=1738845131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.mp4?t=1738845131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>CLOCKWORLD is a narrative adventure game in a world torn apart.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/30d30d58c28adeeac29757d4c6775483.avif?t=1738845131\" /></div><br><br>First he was driven off his island, now he has to deal with memory loss and a strange voice in his head \u2013 Aro seems to be having more than just a bad day.<br>\u200d<br>Venture to the mystical island of Ura and guide him through impactful moral choices, help the enigmatic locals, and discover your own truth as you save the world \u2013 or not. It's all up to you!<br>\u200d<br>In this fantastical adventure, your decisions will pave the way \u2013 what kind of story will you create together?<br><br><i>The clock Is ticking ... </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/9cb13fb5049dc8de8f985823fedb95bb.avif?t=1738845131\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure</h2>Experience a dramatic, captivating and very personal story that will stay with you even after the credits roll!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Visually Outstanding</h2>Immerse yourself in a shattered world of flying, fragmented islands \u2013 in an enchanting, hand-drawn style!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dilemma</h2>Make important decisions and face moral conflicts through an innovative dialogue system!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mess with them</h2>Decide for yourself whether or not to interfere with the lives of the characters you encounter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clockworld</h2>Explore a civilisation with different cultures, traditions, social systems and political beliefs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full English Voice-Over</h2>Featuring the voices of Lin Gothoni (Life is Strange: True Colors), Seumas F. Sargent (Spy City, from Tom of Finland) and Cyrus Nemati (Hades, Pyre)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For Everyone!</h2>Also perfect for casual gamers looking for an exciting adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.poster.avif?t=1738845131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.webm?t=1738845131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/77c0ae6737d9bcbc481adea03520d38b.mp4?t=1738845131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>CLOCKWORLD is a narrative adventure game in a world torn apart.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/30d30d58c28adeeac29757d4c6775483.avif?t=1738845131\" /></div><br><br>First he was driven off his island, now he has to deal with memory loss and a strange voice in his head \u2013 Aro seems to be having more than just a bad day.<br>\u200d<br>Venture to the mystical island of Ura and guide him through impactful moral choices, help the enigmatic locals, and discover your own truth as you save the world \u2013 or not. It's all up to you!<br>\u200d<br>In this fantastical adventure, your decisions will pave the way \u2013 what kind of story will you create together?<br><br><i>The clock Is ticking ... </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767620/extras/9cb13fb5049dc8de8f985823fedb95bb.avif?t=1738845131\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure</h2>Experience a dramatic, captivating and very personal story that will stay with you even after the credits roll!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Visually Outstanding</h2>Immerse yourself in a shattered world of flying, fragmented islands \u2013 in an enchanting, hand-drawn style!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dilemma</h2>Make important decisions and face moral conflicts through an innovative dialogue system!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mess with them</h2>Decide for yourself whether or not to interfere with the lives of the characters you encounter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clockworld</h2>Explore a civilisation with different cultures, traditions, social systems and political beliefs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full English Voice-Over</h2>Featuring the voices of Lin Gothoni (Life is Strange: True Colors), Seumas F. Sargent (Spy City, from Tom of Finland) and Cyrus Nemati (Hades, Pyre)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For Everyone!</h2>Also perfect for casual gamers looking for an exciting adventure!",
    "short_description": "CLOCKWORLD is a narrative adventure game. Join Aro on a mystical journey through a literally broken world. Your decisions are his compass in this fantastic tale about self-determination, destiny and finding purpose.",
